    {
      "itemIdentifier": "csdm.reporting.reports.strata-entitlement",
      "name": "Strata Scheme Entitlement Report",
      "abstract": "Structured report of the unit entitlement of every lot in a strata scheme, with the calculated total. Independent of the source data format: source adapters produce it, and its own transforms present it.",
